# Stage G13, perturbation gate: minimise a cell that was built from the
# RELAXED control by displacing the ridge atoms (scripts/make_perturbed_cell.py).
# No thermal stage: the interfacial Al layer and the slab breathing mode are
# then identical in the control and the strained cell by construction, and
# conjugate gradients only has to relax the local response to the ridge.
